Skills management

Usage: akm skills [COMMAND]

Commands:
  sync     Pull remote → cold library → rebuild symlinks
  add      Add spec(s) to project manifest
  remove   Remove spec(s) from project manifest
  load     Load spec(s) into active session (JIT)
  unload   Remove spec(s) from active session
  loaded   Show specs in active session
  list     Browse library
  search   Search library by keyword
  status   Full status overview
  clean    Remove stale specs
  promote  Import local skill into cold storage
  import   Import a skill from a GitHub URL into cold storage
  edit     Edit a spec's markdown in $EDITOR
  publish  Publish spec to personal registry
  diff     Show what changed locally and in the registry for a spec
  revert   Discard local changes to a spec
  core     Show or reconcile which specs are globally mounted
  libgen   Regenerate library.json from disk
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
